WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.359 --> 00:00:08.240
[drum beats]
 
They used to play without any instruments,

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:12.160
[they would play] on their rifles, their guns.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.800
One historian describes the little ring they have on the Winchester,

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.240
like chak-chak-chak [mimicking beat of the ring], and doing the pisada [foot percussion].

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:25.760
chuck chuck chuck
and doing the pisada [foot percussion].

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:34.939
When this is transposed to instruments like zabumba, it becomes like this [drum beats].

